claims:
1. A method comprising:
identifying a geographic signal in a document;
generating a visual model of the document;
identifying a hierarchical structure of the document based on the visual model;
segmenting the document based on the hierarchical structure and the visual model of the document; and
associating text in the document as text corresponding to the geographic signal when the text does not itself include a geographic signal and when the text is at a higher hierarchical level in the hierarchical structure than the geographic signal.
